  "description": "A retrieval substrate for a body of work its author owns. Every retrievable fragment carries a disclosure policy (public or private; text, gist, locator, or nothing), every hit carries provenance (creators, date, version, identifiers, locator), and the only object a consumer may hand to a model or a caller is a hit whose type cannot hold more than that policy allows. Gists are drafted by the system and authorized by the author. Ships a teaching-sized synthesis consumer that cites or refuses, and an evaluation harness whose gold suite and canary sweep gate every change.",
